<lb n="42"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">erwachsen</unclear> möchte, ihre schifleüth dahin halten wöllen,
<lb n="43"/>dz sie unseren burgeren ihre gütter besouders
<lb n="44"/>führen, die aber dem selben, wie dismahlen der
<lb n="45"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">augenschin</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">mit</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">bracht</unclear>, nicht all wegen nach-
<lb n="46"/>komen etc.
<lb n="47"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Wann</unclear> dann <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">sich</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">die</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">unseren</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">meit</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">solchem</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">billich</unclear>
<lb n="48"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">miß</unclear> nit <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">soellen</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">entgelten</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">laßen</unclear>, und uns
<lb n="49"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">zumahl</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">und</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">gemainer</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">unserer</unclear> statt, an dem
<lb n="50"/>ohngeperten wahren kauff ab solchen orthen nit
